/ Pay action region. Starts as a button; a turbo response swaps it in place for
/ the in-flight spinner and, once the command settles, the result.
/ locals: server_public_id, territory_id, surface, renew_price
/ optional: replace_id, the region the response replaces. Defaults to this
/ button's own region; the retry button overrides it to the result container so
/ a fresh attempt clears the previous error rather than nesting under it.
/ optional: tone, the button's color. Defaults to success; the pay panel passes
/ its urgency tone so the button matches the panel it sits in.
div id=command_action_id("pay", territory_id, surface)
  = button_to server_territory_pay_path(server_public_id, territory_id),
    class: "btn btn-sm btn-#{local_assigns.fetch(:tone, "success")} w-100",
    form: {data: {turbo_confirm: pay_confirm_message(renew_price)}},
    params: {idempotency_key: SecureRandom.uuid, dom_id: local_assigns.fetch(:replace_id) { command_action_id("pay", territory_id, surface) }} do
    i.bi.bi-cash-coin.me-1
    = pay_button_label(renew_price)
